docs {
  ## Method, Endpoint, and Auth

  `GET /api/v1/groups/admin` — Site admin only; Bearer access token required.

  ## Description

  Returns all non-deleted groups, with optional status filtering and pagination.

  ## Request

  ### Headers

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `Authorization` | `string` | Yes | `Bearer <admin-access-token>` |

  ### Query Parameters

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `page` | `integer` | No | 1-based page number; defaults to 1. |
  | `limit` | `integer` | No | Page size from 1 to 100; defaults to 20. |
  | `status` | `string` | No | `ACTIVE` or `INACTIVE`. |

  ## Response

  **`200 OK`**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "items": [
        {
          "id": 42,
          "title": "Weekend trip",
          "created_by_user_id": 7,
          "status": "ACTIVE",
          "is_premium": false,
          "created_at": "2026-11-04T10:00:00Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-11-04T10:00:00Z"
        }
      ],
      "pagination": {
        "page": 1,
        "limit": 20,
        "total": 1
      }
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Errors

  - `400 GROUP_INVALID_PAGINATION` — Invalid `page` or `limit` (including page/offset overflow).
  - `400 GROUP_INVALID_STATUS` — Status is not `ACTIVE` or `INACTIVE`.
  - `401 MISSING_TOKEN` — Access token is missing or invalid.
  - `403 GROUP_FORBIDDEN` — Requester is not a site admin.
}
